{%- comment -%}
  icon-shield — a filled shield with a tick in the current text colour, for
  the header's 30-night guarantee. Decorative: the words beside it say it.
  Output stays on one line.
  Params:
    classes — sizing/layout classes. Default 'size-4 shrink-0'.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign shield_classes = classes | default: 'size-4 shrink-0' -%}
